					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040302,
					"content": "你就是凱亞先生推薦來的線人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040303,
					"content": "什麼線人？不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040304,
					"content": "可是，在這個約好的地方，只有你啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040305,
					"content": "什麼約好的？不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040307,
					"content": "「酒中出真知。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040310,
					"content": "都、都在酒裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040306,
					"content": "哇，真是讓人煩躁的態度！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040307,
						400040310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040308,
					"content": "嗯，是自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040309,
					"content": "這個形式上的流程有什麼意義！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040311,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040312,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040313,
					"content": "嗯，雖然暗號錯了，但如果都在酒裡，那真知也應該在酒裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040314,
					"content": "沒錯。是自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040315,
					"content": "這個形式上的流程有什麼意義！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040316,
					"content": "有什麼想問的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040317,
					"content": "事情是這樣的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040318,
					"content": "這樣嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040319,
					"content": "有什麼內部的消息嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040320,
					"content": "我覺得這應該不是盜寶團所為。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040321,
					"content": "盜寶團能夠打下橫跨多國的基業，是因為他們永遠遵循一個最根本的原則。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040322,
					"content": "——「富貴險中求」都是騙人的鬼話，穩紮穩打才是人間正道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040323,
					"content": "璃月港可是有仙人守護的，尤其是在海燈節期間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040324,
					"content": "",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040325,
					"content": "所以對海燈節出手，這事我們——對不起，角色沒換過來——這事盜寶團絕不會做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040326,
					"content": "而且…璃月那裡的盜寶團組織，最近收到了一封匿名信。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040327,
					"content": "匿名信？難道是有人準備栽贓盜寶團？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040328,
					"content": "這就不得而知了。但我可以告訴你們這封信在盜寶團的哪個分部手裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040329,
					"content": "…好了，已經幫你們標在地圖上了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040330,
					"content": "#嗯，很有收穫！{NICKNAME}，我們要努力抓住這唯一的線索啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040331,
					"content": "那麼，如果沒什麼別的事情，我就回去繼續盜…我是說，回去監視盜寶團了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "寧錄"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4000408,
			"completionStepIds": [
