					"content": "我們想看「那封匿名信」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040906
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400040906,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}為什麼會知道這件事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "貝兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040907,
					"content": "…是、是璃月的仙人告訴我們的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040908,
					"content": "你這句話也編得也太假了吧。",
