					"nextDialogs": [
						400040911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040911,
					"content": "你…你是「護法夜叉」？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "貝兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040912,
					"content": "見到仙人，為什麼反而是這種想要開打的語氣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040913,
					"content": "不是我們不信您是仙人…但大家想，開開眼界。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伶俐鬼"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040914,
					"content": "您也知道，我們盜寶團不做什麼大奸大惡之事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "貝兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040915,
					"content": "您要真是仙人的話，勞煩手下留情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伶俐鬼"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040916,
					"content": "當然，如果不是真正仙人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400040917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "貝兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 400040917,
					"content": "那就休怪我們兵器不長眼睛了。",
